### 1. Publish standard order event
POST http://localhost:5000/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "order-101",
  "customerId": "cust-abc",
  "amount": 99.50,
  "items": [ "sku-keyboard", "sku-mouse" ]
}

### 2. Publish priority order event with custom CloudEvents metadata
POST http://localhost:5000/orders/priority
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "order-999",
  "customerId": "cust-vip",
  "amount": 1499.00,
  "tier": "Gold"
}

### 3. Bulk publish multiple orders in a single request
POST http://localhost:5000/orders/bulk
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "orderId": "order-201", "amount": 25.00 },
  { "orderId": "order-202", "amount": 50.00 },
  { "orderId": "order-203", "amount": 75.00 }
]

### 4. Publish raw byte payload
POST http://localhost:5000/orders/raw
